  "prefLabel": "Agr 1402.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-09-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1402.01 Purpose. The purpose of Agr 1402 is to describe the procedures for individuals seeking to apply for a weighmaster license including the procedure for the initial application, examination requirements and the process for weighmaster license renewal.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Agr 1400) #7462, eff 3-21-01; ss by #9416, INTERIM, eff 3-13-09, EXPIRED: 9-9-09\n\nNew. #9639, eff 1-20-10; ss by #12424, eff 12-1-17 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Agr 1400)",
